{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"header","type":"text","x":0,"y":-360,"width":3280,"height":220,"text":"# 导数与求导\n\n从差商极限建立局部变化率，再由函数结构选择规则；指数、对数与双曲函数沿反函数和链式法则接入。\n\n**连续阅读：** [[01_Math/01_calculus/01_导数与求导|导数与求导：从差商极限到指数与对数]]","color":"4"},
		{"id":"group-definition","type":"group","x":-80,"y":0,"width":3280,"height":500,"label":"1 · 什么是导数，它何时存在","color":"4"},
		{"id":"limit","type":"text","x":0,"y":100,"width":400,"height":220,"text":"## [[函数极限]]\n\n先有趋近语言，才能询问差商在增量趋零时是否稳定。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"derivative","type":"text","x":480,"y":100,"width":400,"height":220,"text":"## [[导数]]\n\n$ f'(x_0)=\\lim_{h\\to0}[f(x_0+h)-f(x_0)]/h $；切线、瞬时率与局部线性系数是同一对象。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"diff-cont","type":"text","x":960,"y":100,"width":400,"height":220,"text":"## [[可导必连续]]\n\n有限差商极限迫使函数增量趋零；这是必要条件。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"cont-not-diff","type":"text","x":1440,"y":100,"width":400,"height":220,"text":"## [[连续不必可导]]\n\n$|x|$ 在零点连续，但左右差商不同；必要条件不能反向。","color":"1"},

		{"id":"group-rules","type":"group","x":-80,"y":620,"width":3280,"height":580,"label":"2 · 差商如何压缩成求导规则","color":"6"},
		{"id":"linear","type":"text","x":0,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[导数线性法则]]\n\n有限和与常数倍可逐项求导；不自动推广到乘积或无穷和。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"power-int","type":"text","x":450,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[整数幂求导]]\n\n二项展开给 $D x^n=nx^{n-1}$；负整数幂保留 $x\\ne0$。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"sine-limit","type":"text","x":900,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[正弦基本极限]]\n\n弧度制下 $\\sin h/h\\to1$；度数会多出比例因子。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"trig-derivative","type":"text","x":1350,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[正弦余弦求导]]\n\n和角公式与小角极限给 $D\\sin=\\cos$、$D\\cos=-\\sin$。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"product","type":"text","x":1800,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[乘积法则]]\n\n乘积有两个一阶变化来源：$(uv)'=u'v+uv'$。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"quotient","type":"text","x":2250,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[商法则]]\n\n先求倒数再乘积；$v\\ne0$ 是原函数定义条件。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"chain","type":"text","x":2700,"y":730,"width":380,"height":230,"text":"## [[链式法则]]\n\n复合把两层局部缩放相乘；每一层都保留定义域。","color":"3"},

		{"id":"group-extensions","type":"group","x":-80,"y":1320,"width":3280,"height":590,"label":"3 · 反复求导、隐式关系与反函数","color":"5"},
		{"id":"higher","type":"text","x":0,"y":1430,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## [[高阶导数]]\n\n把导函数继续求导；存在一阶不自动保证存在下一阶。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"higher-product","type":"text","x":500,"y":1430,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## [[高阶乘积法则]]\n\n二项系数记录 $n$ 次求导怎样分配到两个因子。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"implicit","type":"text","x":1000,"y":1430,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## [[隐式求导]]\n\n沿已有解支对关系求导；每个 $y(x)$ 项都由链式法则带出 $y'$。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"implicit-formula","type":"text","x":1500,"y":1430,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## [[隐函数导数公式]]\n\n定理确认解支后，$Dg=-(D_vF)^{-1}D_uF$；奇异块只使公式失效。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"inverse","type":"text","x":2000,"y":1430,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## [[反函数导数]]\n\n局部可逆且原斜率非零时，对应斜率互为倒数。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"inverse-trig","type":"text","x":2500,"y":1430,"width":420,"height":230,"text":"## [[反三角函数求导]]\n\n主值分支决定 $\\arcsin$、$\\arccos$、$\\arctan$ 的符号与定义域。","color":"6"},

		{"id":"group-explog","type":"group","x":-80,"y":2030,"width":3280,"height":1120,"label":"4 · 指数、对数、实数幂与双曲函数","color":"3"},
		{"id":"exponential","type":"text","x":0,"y":2140,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[指数函数]]\n\n固定 $a>0$，连续扩展 $a^x$ 并保持指数加法律。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"natural-exp","type":"text","x":480,"y":2140,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[自然指数函数]]\n\n选择斜率常数为 $1$ 的底数 $e$；于是 $E(0)=1$、$E'=E$。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"natural-log","type":"text","x":960,"y":2140,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[自然对数]]\n\n$\\ln$ 是 $e^x$ 从正实数到实数的反函数。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"exp-derivative","type":"text","x":1440,"y":2140,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[指数函数求导]]\n\n固定底数时 $D(a^x)=(\\ln a)a^x$；变底数需另处理。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"log-derivative","type":"text","x":1920,"y":2140,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[对数函数求导]]\n\n$D\\ln x=1/x$，且定义域 $x>0$ 属于公式。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"log-diff","type":"text","x":2400,"y":2140,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[对数求导]]\n\n先用对数拆开乘积和移动指数，再从 $y'/y$ 求回 $y'$。","color":"3"},
		{"id":"real-power","type":"text","x":0,"y":2630,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[实数幂求导]]\n\n固定 $r\\in\\mathbb R$ 且 $x>0$ 时，$D x^r=rx^{r-1}$。","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e-limit","type":"text","x":480,"y":2630,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[自然常数极限]]\n\n取对数把 $(1+1/n)^n$ 化成 $\\ln$ 在 $1$ 处的差商。","color":"6"},
		{"id":"hyperbolic","type":"text","x":960,"y":2630,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[双曲函数]]\n\n$\\sinh$ 与 $\\cosh$ 是 $e^x$、$e^{-x}$ 的奇偶组合。","color":"4"},
		{"id":"hyperbolic-derivative","type":"text","x":1440,"y":2630,"width":400,"height":230,"text":"## [[双曲函数求导]]\n\n逐项求导得 $D\\sinh=\\cosh$、$D\\cosh=\\sinh$。","color":"5"}
	],
	"edges":[
